WEBVTT

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.500
Tell us what's going to happen.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:29.656
Are You going to save us, Your Majesty?

00:00:29.656 --> 00:00:32.140
Are You going to save us?

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:36.120
This man too was with Jesus.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.530
Woman, I don't even know Him.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.360
I saw them together.

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:03.910
Your humble servants.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:08.380
How does it feel to look up to somebody?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.230
You are one of them, too.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.380
But I am not.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:45.670
There is no doubt that this man was with Jesus,

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.660
because he is also a Galilean.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.140
Go away.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:52.250
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:00.530
Jesus turned and looked straight at Peter.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:06.240
Then Peter remembered what the Lord had spoken to him:

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:12.410
The cock will not crow this day before you shall three times deny that you know Me.

